New: The structs Portable::internal::batched::FEEvaluationImpl,
FEEvaluationImplCollocation and FEEvaluationImplTransformToCollocation
have been added. They evaluate and integrate values and gradients for a
batch of cells per team using the batched EvaluatorTensorProduct, with
the 1d shape data staged in shared memory by the new
Portable::internal::batched::SharedData struct and the cell range of the
team described by Portable::internal::batched::BatchedData.
